Modular plugins structure:
Scaling Checklist
Aspect	        Recommended Practice
Number of DLLs	Group by entity or domain, not one per plugin
Shared Code	    Move to Common or NuGet package
Registration	 Use PAC CLI and YAML automation
Logging	       Use centralized logging (e.g., Azure App Insights or Dataverse table)
Dependencies	 Avoid direct SDK logic duplication — use service layer
Versioning	   Keep assemblies versioned per module (e.g., 1.2.3 → Account module only)

